WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.312
One day, Cao Cao invited Liu Bei to drink with him and talk about who the true heroes were.

00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:12.182
Cao Cao asked Liu Bei: who in the land could truly be called a hero?

00:00:12.532 --> 00:00:18.916
Liu Bei named several famous men one by one, but Cao Cao shook his head at every one.

00:00:19.266 --> 00:00:23.250
Smiling, Cao Cao pointed at Liu Bei, and then at himself.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:29.288
He said: the true heroes of the land today are only you and I.

00:00:29.638 --> 00:00:34.798
Suddenly thunder roared, Liu Bei's hand shook, and his chopsticks fell to the ground.

00:00:35.148 --> 00:00:42.900
Liu Bei quickly explained that he had feared thunder since childhood, and asked Cao Cao not to take offense.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:48.986
Seeing Liu Bei so timid, Cao Cao nodded with relief and no longer suspected him.

00:00:49.336 --> 00:00:53.416
Liu Bei breathed a sigh of relief and returned home safely.

00:00:53.766 --> 00:00:57.846
From then on, Liu Bei was even more careful, waiting for his opportunity.

